* ============================================================================
* 18_table9_dimension_decomposition.do — H4 机制: 四维度双轨分解
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
*
* PAP v1.0-final §7 (审计冻结):
*   Panel A: full 轨 4 个子指数
*   Panel B: ctx  轨 4 个子指数
*
* 把主 beta 分解到 4 个维度子指数 (core_op / growth /
* resource / compliance), 按 dimension_analysis.py 产出。
*
* 前置条件: 面板须含
*   benefit_{core_op,growth,resource,compliance}_{full,ctx}
* fix(omni-gapfill-10, 2026-06-12): 此前注释指向不存在的
* pipeline/features/benefit_society.py::merge_dimensions_to_panel (全仓无此函数,
* 幻影前置)。真实产出链:
*   (1) python -m news_process.papers.benefit_society.dimension_analysis
*       --df-exploded <24_herd_decay.parquet> --track both
*       → 27_benefit_dimensions_panel.parquet
*   (2) papers/benefit_society/dimension_analysis.py::merge_dimensions_to_panel
*       把维度列并进面板副本 (不改写主 40_panel_yearly.parquet) 后再 export .dta。
*
* H4 验收标准: 4 个子指数中至少 2 个与主 beta 同号且 p<0.10。
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

set seed {{RANDOM_SEED}}

* ----- Panel A: full 轨 -----
reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}}_w {{ATTITUDE_FULL}} $controls, ///
    absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
eststo D_main_full

foreach dim in core_op growth resource compliance {
    capture confirm variable benefit_`dim'_full
    if _rc == 0 {
        reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}}_w benefit_`dim'_full $controls, ///
            absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
        eststo D_`dim'_full
    }
    else {
        display "[WARN] benefit_`dim'_full not in panel; run merge_dimensions_to_panel first"
    }
}

* ----- Panel B: ctx 轨 -----
capture confirm variable {{ATTITUDE_CTX}}
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}}_w {{ATTITUDE_CTX}} $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo D_main_ctx

    foreach dim in core_op growth resource compliance {
        capture confirm variable benefit_`dim'_ctx
        if _rc == 0 {
            reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}}_w benefit_`dim'_ctx $controls, ///
                absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
            eststo D_`dim'_ctx
        }
    }
}

* ----- 合并输出 -----
* fix(omni-gapfill-14, 2026-06-12): esttab 名单动态化 — 8 个维度估计全部在
* capture confirm 守卫块内, 旧版硬点名 10 个 eststo 名 → 维度列缺失时 r(111)
* (再被 00_master 的 capture do 吞掉, H4 机制表无声缺失零报错)。现按
* estimates dir 实际存在名单拼装 + mtitle 同步, 全缺时显式 as error 告警。
qui estimates dir
local stored `r(names)'
local cand_models D_main_full D_core_op_full D_growth_full D_resource_full ///
                  D_compliance_full D_main_ctx D_core_op_ctx D_growth_ctx ///
                  D_resource_ctx D_compliance_ctx
local cand_titles `""Main-F" "Core-Op-F" "Growth-F" "Resource-F" "Compliance-F" "Main-C" "Core-Op-C" "Growth-C" "Resource-C" "Compliance-C""'
local models ""
local mtitles `""'
local nmod : word count `cand_models'
forvalues i = 1/`nmod' {
    local m : word `i' of `cand_models'
    if `: list m in stored' {
        local models `models' `m'
        local t : word `i' of `cand_titles'
        local mtitles `"`mtitles' "`t'""'
    }
}
if "`models'" == "" {
    display as error "  [WARN] Table 9 无任何已存储估计 (维度列全缺, 先跑 dimension_analysis + merge_dimensions_to_panel); 表跳过"
}
else {
    esttab `models' ///
        using "$tables_dir/table9_dimension.tex", replace ///
        star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) se booktabs label compress b(3) ///
        title("Mechanism: 4-Dimension Decomposition (full + ctx, PAP §7)") ///
        mtitles(`mtitles') ///
        addnotes("Bank (bank_id) + year FE; cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}}; dimensions per stage 27 anchors." ///
                 "Columns suffixed -F (full track) / -C (ctx track); missing dimensions omitted." ///
                 "H4 acceptance: >=2/4 sub-indices share sign at p<0.10 (full track primary)." ///
                 "Dual-track convergent validity: cross-panel sign concordance reported separately.")
}

display "[OK] Table 9 dimension --> $tables_dir/table9_dimension.tex"
